{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS &quot;STARNAUT&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;STARNAUT&quot; is an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master &quot;survivor-like&quot; game that emphasizes massive Nitro Jumps and Dashes, evading with verticality, synergizing extremely powerful weapons, deep and considered lore, and of course, the strongest force in the universe....love! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your 8 favourite weapons, and annihilate endless hordes of enemies! Feel the excitement of mowing down entire armies of the creeping terror known only as ZOL!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BE CAREFUL!! This game is way too addictive! Time flies when you're having fun! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Humanity is Extinct. Earth is Lost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Copiasu, a designer baby created by two AIs, carries the final hopes of humanity. After Earth was torn apart by a multi-dimensional rift, he must dive into the multiverse and take on the mantle of Earth's final starfarer: Starnaut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u03a9 Rockets, holding Earth's final records, lie scattered throughout the space between dimensions. Finding and launching them all is the only path to Earth's rebirth! Driven by this hope, Starnaut forges ahead into the unknown multiverse, ready for anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_01_New.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>NOTICE: Although this game features &quot;gacha&quot; as a plot element, it is NOT a &quot;gacha game&quot;!! Don't get it twisted!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The STARNAUT himself, and no one else, carries this torch burning bright, encoded inside his mind and in his heart, and to remember is to care, about each and every bit of it. Truly an enormous responsibility, by any measure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is a miracle, but he is still a person, same as you, who needs the love and support of others, and there are things about people that no circumstance can change.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the doomsday, people launched the <strong>Omega Rockets</strong> with thier precious memories and history but they ended up landing in multiverse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starnaut runs today to find out if all of the rockets were launched back, so the Earth will be ressurected. ...or not!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_01.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mission 1: Explore the Multiverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starnaut's unique power draws together distant realities through the multiverse, forming the stages where your battles unfold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 distinct zones await, with more lurking beyond. Clear them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_02.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 2: Survive the Invasion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down swarms of invaders pouring from the multiverse! Some look cute, but don't be fooled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not an expert at shooters? No problem! Your weapons attack automatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_03_New.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 3: Power Up with Coins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies drop coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend them at the Shopnaut for crucial weapon upgrades and power-ups during your run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_04_sm_america.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 4: Launch Rockets and Get Oxygen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch 10 \u03a9 Rockets to clear each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They're also your lifeline, providing vital oxygen \u2013 activate them regularly to stay alive!<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_05.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><strong>Mission 5: Collect Earth's data!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down elusive carriers holding fragments of Earth's &quot;Lost Data.&quot; Punch them to retrieve these vital records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_06.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission.... WHATEVER!! JUST BEAT EM AS MANY AS YOU CAN!!!!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those enemies are not only hungry for you but YOUR KNUCKLE SANDWICH!!! <br><br>There are things like a gacha capsule, jump pad or even a hot spring! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, you can buy a new helmet and upgrade your spacesuit to enhance your basic abilities before you start the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything for you! Just use them well!! <br><br><strong>STARNAUT, FIGHT SOLO! ANNIHILATE EM!</strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_07.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tips for Getting Started</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Remember: Defeat Enemies -&gt; Collect Coins -&gt; Visit Shopnaut!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Upgrade your weapons and suit to handle the escalating threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    The Antenna weapon set is a great all-rounder when you're starting out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Getting Armor or Auto-Recovery early on makes you harder to take down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Once bought, weapons have infinite ammo and never break!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Don't ignore the tips from Wonderful coming through the antenna on your head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mouse/Keyboard and Controllers are supported.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"''THE BEGINNING SQUARE' Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/154a5c78cded3efabf8e96e67d45f85570a487fd.jpg"},{"name":"'THE BEGINNING SQUARE' Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/bb80d1cb09a114633c07f634bc7401400b4ad3a6.jpg"},{"name":"'THE BEGINNING SQUARE' Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/12556573d885efbd3969a2fb9fcf829037f4edfc.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVIMACHINA' Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/8ff549387c7d2b23c9e35b1e4d122d41259b44fc.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVIMACHINA' Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/d30ed66d94e86629061cc2e8be1dbd34e9fb9f28.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVIMACHINA' Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/8e017bfd22e7be1400f554b9e302a21d5d0c4d03.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVE OF MONSTROSITIES' Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/c7b41879f7362c6a1717e3135418596d91271067.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVE OF MONSTROSITIES' Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/9a83310265f2610f3f3037074b79216dca9aef0f.jpg"},{"name":"'GRAVE OF MONSTROSITIES' Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/c3e6e52f66b23f1fcfee33bc9e8250c6ce5b3142.jpg"},{"name":"'RUINS OF GIGA-ALIEN' Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2508940/f18ecc14cb4cea6e51acc3536aa409d0295acb11.jpg"}],"total":52},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2508940?t=1744019199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744019199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/aa34da0a3eb673fc125b4c2faa90713e23e8dbb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744019199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/aa34da0a3eb673fc125b4c2faa90713e23e8dbb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744019199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS &quot;STARNAUT&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;STARNAUT&quot; is an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master &quot;survivor-like&quot; game that emphasizes massive Nitro Jumps and Dashes, evading with verticality, synergizing extremely powerful weapons, deep and considered lore, and of course, the strongest force in the universe....love! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your 8 favourite weapons, and annihilate endless hordes of enemies! Feel the excitement of mowing down entire armies of the creeping terror known only as ZOL!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BE CAREFUL!! This game is way too addictive! Time flies when you're having fun! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Humanity is Extinct. Earth is Lost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Copiasu, a designer baby created by two AIs, carries the final hopes of humanity. After Earth was torn apart by a multi-dimensional rift, he must dive into the multiverse and take on the mantle of Earth's final starfarer: Starnaut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u03a9 Rockets, holding Earth's final records, lie scattered throughout the space between dimensions. Finding and launching them all is the only path to Earth's rebirth! Driven by this hope, Starnaut forges ahead into the unknown multiverse, ready for anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_01_New.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>NOTICE: Although this game features &quot;gacha&quot; as a plot element, it is NOT a &quot;gacha game&quot;!! Don't get it twisted!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The STARNAUT himself, and no one else, carries this torch burning bright, encoded inside his mind and in his heart, and to remember is to care, about each and every bit of it. Truly an enormous responsibility, by any measure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is a miracle, but he is still a person, same as you, who needs the love and support of others, and there are things about people that no circumstance can change.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the doomsday, people launched the <strong>Omega Rockets</strong> with thier precious memories and history but they ended up landing in multiverse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starnaut runs today to find out if all of the rockets were launched back, so the Earth will be ressurected. ...or not!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_01.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mission 1: Explore the Multiverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starnaut's unique power draws together distant realities through the multiverse, forming the stages where your battles unfold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 15 distinct zones await, with more lurking beyond. Clear them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_02.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 2: Survive the Invasion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down swarms of invaders pouring from the multiverse! Some look cute, but don't be fooled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not an expert at shooters? No problem! Your weapons attack automatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_03_New.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 3: Power Up with Coins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeated enemies drop coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend them at the Shopnaut for crucial weapon upgrades and power-ups during your run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_04_sm_america.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission 4: Launch Rockets and Get Oxygen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch 10 \u03a9 Rockets to clear each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They're also your lifeline, providing vital oxygen \u2013 activate them regularly to stay alive!<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_05.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br><strong>Mission 5: Collect Earth's data!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt down elusive carriers holding fragments of Earth's &quot;Lost Data.&quot; Punch them to retrieve these vital records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_06.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mission.... WHATEVER!! JUST BEAT EM AS MANY AS YOU CAN!!!!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those enemies are not only hungry for you but YOUR KNUCKLE SANDWICH!!! <br><br>There are things like a gacha capsule, jump pad or even a hot spring! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, you can buy a new helmet and upgrade your spacesuit to enhance your basic abilities before you start the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything for you! Just use them well!! <br><br><strong>STARNAUT, FIGHT SOLO! ANNIHILATE EM!</strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/extras/Starnaut_gif_07.gif.gif?t=1744019199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tips for Getting Started</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Remember: Defeat Enemies -&gt; Collect Coins -&gt; Visit Shopnaut!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Upgrade your weapons and suit to handle the escalating threats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    The Antenna weapon set is a great all-rounder when you're starting out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Getting Armor or Auto-Recovery early on makes you harder to take down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Once bought, weapons have infinite ammo and never break!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Don't ignore the tips from Wonderful coming through the antenna on your head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mouse/Keyboard and Controllers are supported.</strong></p>","developers":["crim Co., Ltd."],"dlc":[2776850,2776880],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508940/0af4aa23159fdb80aa2eb5e9f4fd395fc707d7bc/header.jpg?t=1744019199","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9crim","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5  or inten Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114397,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114397/movie480.mp4?t=1741953135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114397/movie_max.mp4?t=1741953135"},"name":"PlayMovie1-2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114397/27d5919d4e127d9b6a06f2f42e1db501a6fd1829/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741953135","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114397/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741953135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114397/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741953135"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257114428,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114428/movie480.mp4?t=1741953141","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114428/movie_max.mp4?t=1741953141"},"name":"PlayMovie1-4","thumbnail